{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38977","headline":"恩门致书远及山居因献之 · 杜荀鹤","name":"恩门致书远及山居因献之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时难转觉保身难，难向师门欲继颜。\n若把白衣轻易脱，却成青桂偶然攀。\n身居劒戟争雄地，道在乾坤未丧间。\n必许酬恩酬未晚，且须容到九华山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38977.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38977","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}